{
  "videoId": "wmiIUN-7qhE",
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Everyone, Bonnie made a friend in class!",
      "start": 1.001,
      "end": 3.094
    },
    {
      "text": "She's already making friends.",
      "start": 2.794,
      "end": 4.971
    },
    {
      "text": "No, no she literally made a new friend.",
      "start": 4.671,
      "end": 7.8069999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "I want you to meet... Forky!",
      "start": 7.507,
      "end": 10.435
    },
    {
      "text": "Hello! Hi!",
      "start": 11.136,
      "end": 12.395
    },
    {
      "text": "He's a spork!",
      "start": 13.096,
      "end": 14.897
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, yeah, I know.",
      "start": 14.597,
      "end": 16.024
    },
    {
      "text": "Forky is the most important toy",
      "start": 17.726,
      "end": 18.768
    },
    {
      "text": "To Bonnie right now.",
      "start": 18.768,
      "end": 20.486
    },
    {
      "text": "We all have to make sure nothing happens to him.",
      "start": 20.478,
      "end": 23.072000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Woody! We have a situation.",
      "start": 23.857,
      "end": 25.366
    },
    {
      "text": "I am not a toy.",
      "start": 26.151,
      "end": 27.618000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "I was made for soup, salad, maybe chili, and then the trash!",
      "start": 27.318,
      "end": 31.497000000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Buzz! We've gotta get Forky!",
      "start": 33.074,
      "end": 34.708999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "Am I alive?",
      "start": 39.539,
      "end": 40.882
    },
    {
      "text": "You're Bonnie's toy.",
      "start": 40.582,
      "end": 42.257999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "You are going to help create happy memories that will last",
      "start": 41.958,
      "end": 45.260999999999996
    },
    {
      "text": "For the rest of her life!",
      "start": 44.961,
      "end": 47.388
    },
    {
      "text": "Bo? Forky, come on!",
      "start": 53.178,
      "end": 55.145999999999994
    },
    {
      "text": "Hi there! My name is Gabby Gabby.",
      "start": 56.431,
      "end": 58.690999999999995
    },
    {
      "text": "We can't stay.",
      "start": 58.391,
      "end": 59.69199999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Haha, yes you can. Boys?",
      "start": 59.392,
      "end": 62.07
    },
    {
      "text": "Woody, behind you!",
      "start": 63.73,
      "end": 65.365
    },
    {
      "text": "Bo! What are you doing here?",
      "start": 66.024,
      "end": 67.825
    },
    {
      "text": "No time to explain.",
      "start": 67.525,
      "end": 69.202
    },
    {
      "text": "Come with me.",
      "start": 68.902,
      "end": 69.869
    },
    {
      "text": "We need to get back to our kid.",
      "start": 69.569,
      "end": 71.204
    },
    {
      "text": "Sheriff Woody, always comin' to the rescue.",
      "start": 70.904,
      "end": 74.832
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonnie needs Forky.",
      "start": 74.532,
      "end": 76.08399999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Woody, who needs a kid's room",
      "start": 75.784,
      "end": 77.869
    },
    {
      "text": "When you can have all of this...?",
      "start": 77.869,
      "end": 81.172
    },
    {
      "text": "Woody, aren't we goin' to Bonnie?",
      "start": 81.831,
      "end": 84.425
    },
    {
      "text": "We have to find them.",
      "start": 86.044,
      "end": 87.303
    },
    {
      "text": "What do we do, Buzz?",
      "start": 87.003,
      "end": 88.304
    },
    {
      "text": "What would Woody do?",
      "start": 88.004,
      "end": 89.305
    },
    {
      "text": "Jump out of a moving vehicle.",
      "start": 89.005,
      "end": 90.306
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's go!",
      "start": 90.173,
      "end": 91.516
    },
    {
      "text": "If you gotta go, you gotta go.",
      "start": 91.216,
      "end": 93.226
    },
    {
      "text": "You know, you've handled",
      "start": 97.097,
      "end": 98.723
    },
    {
      "text": "This lost toy life better than I could.",
      "start": 98.723,
      "end": 101.234
    },
    {
      "text": "Open your eyes Woody.",
      "start": 100.934,
      "end": 102.985
    },
    {
      "text": "There's plenty of kids out there.",
      "start": 102.685,
      "end": 104.946
    },
    {
      "text": "Sometimes change can be good.",
      "start": 104.646,
      "end": 106.197
    },
    {
      "text": "You can't teach this old toy new tricks.",
      "start": 105.897,
      "end": 108.324
    },
    {
      "text": "You'd be surprised.",
      "start": 108.024,
      "end": 109.283
    },
    {
      "text": "We're going home, Forky!",
      "start": 111.069,
      "end": 112.62
    },
    {
      "text": "Bonnie, I'm comin'!",
      "start": 114.572,
      "end": 115.915
    },
    {
      "text": "On my way Woody!",
      "start": 117.117,
      "end": 118.459
    },
    {
      "text": "To infinity... and beyond!",
      "start": 118.159,
      "end": 120.503
    },
    {
      "text": "Don't let Woody leave!",
      "start": 125.875,
      "end": 127.25999999999999
    },
    {
      "text": "Kids lose their toys every day.",
      "start": 127.669,
      "end": 129.929
    },
    {
      "text": "I was made to help a child.",
      "start": 129.629,
      "end": 132.014
    },
    {
      "text": "I don't remember it being this hard.",
      "start": 131.714,
      "end": 133.85000000000002
    },
    {
      "text": "Somebody's whispering in your ear...",
      "start": 134.425,
      "end": 135.76800000000003
    },
    {
      "text": "Everything's gonna be ok.",
      "start": 137.053,
      "end": 138.98000000000002
    }
  ],
